Is the bear still there?

18
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:55,940
The book is willing to buy Uncle Zhou for a high price of 20 yuan.

19
00:00:55,940 --> 00:00:59,050
Don't talk nonsense if you still have such a thing at your age.

20
00:00:59,330 --> 00:01:01,170
