Grind that stuff into powder and add it to the concentrate

22
00:01:02,890 --> 00:01:05,010
Breed to Shengkou, Biduozai Leqiang, Uncle Zhou

23
00:01:05,010 --> 00:01:06,290
Sorry, I misunderstood

24
00:01:06,290 --> 00:01:09,050
Then next time there is something on the side of the road, it would be better if I leave it for you.

25
00:01:09,050 --> 00:01:11,370
