That’s it. Buy it and take a look.

32
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:32,540
We sold more than 2,800 yuan today. Do you think this money is not enough to buy just one watch?

33
00:01:32,540 --> 00:01:34,420
Keep the rest for your wife’s father

34
00:01:34,420 --> 00:01:37,100
I want to add a washing machine to the rooftop of my house. Are you crazy about the TV washing machine?

35
00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:38,220
Not everyone in the sky has them.

36
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:43,360
Then I'll buy a watch for my mother. There's also the eldest sister, the second sister, and the third sister.

37
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:48,200
I think you don’t want to buy this watch today. Let’s go back. Dad, listen to me. I’ll listen.

38
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:49,800
I just want you to live a good life

39
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,520
Buy a rice cooker for my mother

40
