43
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:57,320
Buy a TV to help you solve the problem

44
00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:02,210
I just want you to let my mother

45
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:06,980
Let all the sisters have a better life

46
