I think you are drifting

47
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:09,500
None of these things cost money

48
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:10,620
One person buys a watch

49
00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:12,060
The TV and washing machine will wait until you finish picking up your wife.

50
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:15,420
Dad, let me ask you if you have a daughter

51
00:02:15,420 --> 00:02:17,660
Are you willing to marry someone who has a refrigerator, electricity, and a washing machine at home?

52
00:02:17,660 --> 00:02:19,060
