53
00:02:19,060 --> 00:02:20,260
Those who are willing to give more money

54
00:02:20,260 --> 00:02:22,700
You must be marrying your daughter because you want to, not for money.

55
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:25,620
good boy

56
00:02:25,620 --> 00:02:29,580
I changed my hair and said I was cheating, dad. Since that’s the case, I thought about it.

57
00:02:29,580 --> 00:02:30,580
I will never go into the mountains again.

58
00:02:30,580 --> 00:02:31,660
Just like my third brother, I lie down every day

59
00:02:31,660 --> 00:02:36,470
I won’t take a wife anymore.

60
00:02:36,470 --> 00:02:37,750
Dad, what did you ask me to do?

61
00:02:37,750 --> 00:02:43,480
sit down for me

62
00:02:43,480 --> 00:02:45,280
From now on, you will control half of the money spent on hunting.

63
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:47,090
Ask your mother to keep the remaining half

64
00:02:47,090 --> 00:02:48,900
Dad, you have the final say

65
00:02:48,900 --> 00:02:51,770
For important events, she invited me to go to the county seat.
